$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Tyr's Cradle\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Snow and ice\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Night\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Both the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes have established bases on this frozen world, and neither will back down. To claim this planet, your tribe must destroy the enemy's generators and pulse sensor, hold both towers, and capture the enemy flag 6 times. The towers, located in the northeast and southwest quadrants of the map, each contain vehicle purchase stations.";
$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
